# The Ansible vault is intentionally DIFFERENT per branch:
#   * main (and feature branches) → PUBLIC demo vault, decryptable with the
#     committed ops/ansible/.vault_pass.public
#   * deploy/motorbrot_prod       → REAL secrets, decryptable only with the
#     private ANSIBLE_VAULT_PASSWORD (never committed)
#
# `merge=ours` makes every branch KEEP ITS OWN vault.yml on a merge, so a
# main→prod (or feature→prod) merge can never overwrite the real secrets, and a
# prod→main merge can never leak them onto main. Enable the driver once per
# clone / CI runner:
#     git config merge.ours.driver true
# Without it, git safely falls back to a normal merge (→ conflict), never a
# silent clobber.
ops/ansible/inventory/group_vars/all/vault.yml merge=ours
